# Pairs with GateOwnership. The capture must release its split gate before it calls the root.
MODULE: CaptureCKeepsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a capture split of C moves on to link without releasing C's split gate
PERTURBS: CaptureSplitC

--- FIND
    /\ cap["C"] = "splitting"
    /\ gate' = [gate EXCEPT !["C"] = "free"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ cap["C"] = "splitting"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is kept
    /\ gate' = gate
--- END
